    {
      "id": "heldout-criteria-load-tested:seg:0",
      "text": "The new search endpoint is merged. Relevance looks much better in the side-by-side."
    },
    {
      "id": "heldout-criteria-load-tested:seg:1",
      "text": "Latency is fine on my machine, but that's a hundred documents, not two million."
    },
    {
      "id": "heldout-criteria-load-tested:seg:2",
      "text": "The index on production is a lot bigger, yes."
    },
    {
      "id": "heldout-criteria-load-tested:seg:3",
      "text": "So, plan: once it's load tested, we switch traffic over."
    },
    {
      "id": "heldout-criteria-load-tested:seg:4",
      "text": "OK. I'll do the load test this week."
    },
    {
      "id": "heldout-criteria-load-tested:seg:5",
      "text": "I'll keep the old endpoint running for two weeks after the switch, in case we need to roll back."
    },
    {
      "id": "heldout-criteria-load-tested:seg:6",
      "text": "Good. And the switch happens behind the search flag, not a deploy."
    },
    {
      "id": "heldout-criteria-load-tested:seg:7",
      "text": "Yes, flag only."
    },
    {
      "id": "heldout-criteria-load-tested:seg:8",
      "text": "Should we tell the mobile team? Their app calls search directly."
    },
    {
      "id": "heldout-criteria-load-tested:seg:9",
      "text": "I'll message them today."
    },
    {
      "id": "heldout-criteria-load-tested:seg:10",
      "text": "Thanks."
    },
    {
      "id": "heldout-criteria-load-tested:seg:11",
      "text": "That's all. Thanks."
    }
